WEBVTT

00:08:58.298 --> 00:09:02.213
most elementary solution
to a problem that was possible.

00:09:02.237 --> 00:09:05.762
If it wasn't possible,
you had to use something fancier.

00:09:06.469 --> 00:09:11.041
No doubt, part of this
was his great joy and pleasure

00:09:11.065 --> 00:09:14.497
in showing people that he could
think more simply than they could.

00:09:14.837 --> 00:09:17.996
But he also deeply believed,
he truly believed,

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:20.260
that if you couldn't explain
something simply,

00:09:20.284 --> 00:09:21.815
you didn't understand it.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:26.393
In the 1950s, people
were trying to figure out

00:09:26.417 --> 00:09:28.393
how superfluid helium worked.

00:09:29.313 --> 00:09:30.489
There was a theory.